      summary: "Ask the assistant (assistant.use; owner only, others 404; If-Match = the conversation; rate-limit class assistant). Appends the prompt, then, outside any transaction, applies the refused-intent rule, retrieves only records the caller may read (search and ReadScope) and playbook passages, and calls the configured provider only when something was retrieved; then appends one reply (answer with citations, refusal, no_sources, unavailable) and its suggestions. Writes nothing outside the assistant tables. Audit assistant_conversation.message_posted, .reply_recorded, assistant_suggestion.created. 409 assistant.reply_pending or version conflict; 422 assistant.disabled, assistant.conversation_full. ADR-0059 §4-§9; REQ-S17-007, REQ-S17-008, REQ-S17-011."
